From 4a057b85d36a08c385379010f58c606d28832837 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:16:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Preserve mailbox work across interrupted task starts

Interrupting or replacing an automatic parent turn before its task registers no longer drops mail the turn had taken. Unobserved child results and unrelated input return to the session queue, and an interrupt keeps background results from waking the parent again.
